<p>Haye sakina haye sakina </p>

<p>Thi shaam ke zindaan me sakina ki yeh sada, <br />
 Mere Baba aao , Mere baba aao<br />
Bin aapke iss Qaid me dushwaar hai jeena,<br />
 Mere baba aao , mere baba aao</p>

<p>
1) Sajjad mere bhayya kaisi yeh musibat hai,<br />
Zaalim ke tamacho'n se har lamha Aziyat hai,<br />
Baali sakina roti hai, chaaya hai andhera <br />
 Mere baba aao , mere baba aao</p>

<p>
2) Kab hoyegi is Qaid se jaane mujhe raahat,<br />
Shayad issi zindaan me hojayegi rehlat,<br />
Sunkar yeh bayaan bibiyo'n, me ek hai sakta<br />
 Mere baba aao , mere baba aao</p>

<p>
3) Kehti hai phupi kuch tou hume bolo sakina,<br />
Aao yaha'n rassi tou zara kholo sakina,<br />
Masooma ke laboo pa hai, har dum yahi sada<br />
 Mere baba aao , mere baba aao</p>

<p>
4) Kya aap hame Qaid se chudwaoge baba,<br />
Yaa mujhko isi tarha se rulwaoge baba,<br />
Ammu bhi nahi kisse, karungi mai yeh shikwa<br />
 Mere baba aao , mere baba aao</p>

<p>
5) Kaano se lahoo behta hai har waqt humaare,<br />
Jo aapne pehnaye the cheene gaye bunde,<br />
Ab aur sitam sehne ki taaqat nahi baba<br />
 Mere baba aao , mere baba aao</p>

<p>
6) Jis ghar ne na ho umme Rabbab aur sakina,<br />
Sheh kehte the wo ghar mujhe acha nahi lagta,<br />
Aaye hai Hussain ibne Ali sunke yeh buka<br />
 Mere baba aao, mere baba aao</p>

<p>
7) Jab laashe sakina pa hua aakhri matam,<br />
Sab bibiya zainab ke qaree'n aagayi us dum,<br />
Is haal me Abid ka, bane kaun sahara<br />
 Mere baba aao , mere baba aao</p>

<p>
8) Dil phatta hai ashko ki rawani hai sakina,<br />
Kaisi tumhari tashna-dahani hai sakina,<br />
Pursa yeh pesh karti hai, ab Nasere Aza</p>

<p>
9) Kaise bayaan wo zulm ki rudaad ho hyder,<br />
Us waqt Qaidiyo me bapa hogaya mehshar,<br />
Jab toot'ti sanso me sakina ne pukara<br />
 Mere baba aao , mere baba aao</p>